        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://cityofmaypearl.org/community/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The city sits on Farm Road 66, about ten miles southwest of Waxahachie in western Ellis County.",
